    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Karl's Mansion is..\u00a0 \u00a0well..\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >let's just say it needs to be cleaned up ok???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420800/extras/97f86591871c9b8491480326fbd47b97.poster.avif?t=1742765472\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420800/extras/97f86591871c9b8491480326fbd47b97.webm?t=1742765472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420800/extras/97f86591871c9b8491480326fbd47b97.mp4?t=1742765472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barricade Windows and Doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setup &amp; Plan your Traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra Stamina &amp; Health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rifle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatchet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grenade / Grenade Launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chainsaw</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HMG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-Combat Actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud835\udc7e\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc8d\ud835\udc84\ud835\udc90\ud835\udc8e\ud835\udc86 \ud835\udc83\ud835\udc82\ud835\udc84\ud835\udc8c \ud835\udc8a\ud835\udc8f \ud835\udc79\ud835\udc90\ud835\udc94\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc83\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc93\ud835\udc88 \ud835\udc7b\ud835\udc90\ud835\udc98\ud835\udc8f!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420800/extras/4b8471029551b8e78e3bc88af4779454.avif?t=1742765472\" width=490 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room 54 - Horde Survival is heavily inspired to Call of Duty WWII Zombie Survival modality,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specifically to the Gr\u00f6esten Haus Map,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in this mode you will Need to survive against hundreds or maybe thousands of enemies that will use any possible way to enter Dr. Karl's Mansion ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against a competitive AI ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and special abilities with Batch Points (in-game Points)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That you can only earn beating the enemy waves or conpleting special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer that was an intense work, i'm putting all the efforts to improve the game and also to add new content, Room 54 - HS will be supported in a long term period with regular updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
